WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.131 --> 00:00:15.952
Meanwhile, back in the town of Oliver's birth, Mr.

2
00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:18.152
Bumble was about to set off on a trip to London.

3
00:00:19.153 --> 00:00:24.214
He was feeling quite important this morning because the workhouse board had appointed him to take two paupers

4
00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:24.815
to the city.

5
00:00:25.895 --> 00:00:29.356
He was going to appear before a court to argue that they belonged to another parish.

6
00:00:30.408 --> 00:00:30.828
So Mr.

7
00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:35.209
Bumble took his place on top of the coach, accompanied by the two men in their ragged clothes.

8
00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:40.211
Throughout the trip the paupers persisted in shivering and complaining about the cold.

9
00:00:41.271 --> 00:00:42.011
This annoyed Mr.

10
00:00:42.031 --> 00:00:45.312
Bumble and made his teeth chatter even though he was wearing a heavy coat.

11
00:00:46.372 --> 00:00:47.853
By evening they reached London.

12
00:00:48.893 --> 00:00:51.994
Having disposed of the paupers in a workhouse for the night, Mr.

13
00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:54.415
Bumble settled himself at a warm and cozy inn.

14
00:00:55.535 --> 00:00:59.036
He had a modest dinner of steaks, oyster sauce, and fine wine.

15
00:01:01.008 --> 00:01:04.630
After dinner he set a drink on the mantel and pulled his chair over to the fire.

16
00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:08.492
Then he composed himself for an evening of reading the newspaper.

17
00:01:09.512 --> 00:01:16.856
The very first paragraph on which his eye rested was the following advertisement: FIVE POUNDS REWARD A young

18
00:01:16.896 --> 00:01:21.558
boy named Oliver Twist ran away, or was enticed away, from his home last Thursday.

19
00:01:22.599 --> 00:01:24.600
He has not been seen or heard from since.

20
00:01:25.728 --> 00:01:30.312
The above reward will be paid to any person who gives information that leads to the discovery of

21
00:01:30.452 --> 00:01:31.193
Oliver Twist.

22
00:01:32.314 --> 00:01:37.138
The above reward is also offered to anyone who can throw light on the boy's previous history.

23
00:01:38.219 --> 00:01:41.783
The advertiser has many reasons for being interested in the boy's past.

24
00:01:42.924 --> 00:01:44.946
Mr. Bumble opened his eyes in surprise.

25
00:01:46.047 --> 00:01:50.030
There followed a full description of Oliver's clothing and appearance, with Mr.

26
00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:51.712
Brownlow's name and address underneath.

27
00:01:53.576 --> 00:01:57.097
Mr. Bumble read the advertisement slowly and carefully three times.

28
00:01:58.317 --> 00:02:01.258
And in something more than five minutes, he was on his way to Mr.

29
00:02:01.278 --> 00:02:04.279
Brownlow's house, having left his drink untasted on the mantel.

30
00:02:04.299 --> 00:02:05.840
"Is Mr.

31
00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:06.620
Brownlow at home?"

32
00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:07.620
inquired Mr.

33
00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.621
Bumble of the servant girl who opened the door.

34
00:02:10.681 --> 00:02:13.922
The girl replied as any good servant would: "I don't know, sir.

35
00:02:14.922 --> 00:02:16.442
What is the nature of your business with him?"

36
00:02:17.443 --> 00:02:21.504
Mr. Bumble explained that he had come in reference to the advertisement about Oliver Twist.

37
00:02:22.612 --> 00:02:23.612
Hearing that, Mrs.

38
00:02:23.672 --> 00:02:28.034
Bedwin, who had been standing at the parlor door, hurried into the hall in a breathless state.

39
00:02:29.094 --> 00:02:31.534
"Come in, come in," said the old woman.

40
00:02:31.554 --> 00:02:33.735
"I knew we would hear of him.

41
00:02:34.775 --> 00:02:35.556
Poor dear!

42
00:02:35.996 --> 00:02:36.696
I knew we would.

43
00:02:38.556 --> 00:02:39.417
I was certain of it.

44
00:02:40.417 --> 00:02:41.297
Bless his heart.

45
00:02:42.337 --> 00:02:43.518
I said so all along."

46
00:02:44.518 --> 00:02:47.899
Having said this, the housekeeper hurried back into the parlor again.

47
00:02:49.039 --> 00:02:51.480
She sat down on the sofa and burst into tears.

48
00:02:52.636 --> 00:02:56.297
Meanwhile the girl had run upstairs and now returned with a request that Mr.

49
00:02:56.317 --> 00:02:57.817
Bumble follow her immediately.

50
00:02:58.938 --> 00:03:00.438
She showed him upstairs into Mr.

51
00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:01.178
Brownlow's study.

52
00:03:01.198 --> 00:03:03.119
"Take a seat, will you?"

53
00:03:03.459 --> 00:03:03.859
said Mr.

54
00:03:03.879 --> 00:03:07.940
Brownlow. He moved the lamp so as to obtain a good view of Mr.

55
00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:08.580
Bumble's face.

56
00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:13.202
"Now, sir, you have come as a result of seeing the newspaper advertisement?"

57
00:03:14.242 --> 00:03:15.502
"Yes, sir," said Mr.

58
00:03:15.542 --> 00:03:16.562
Bumble as he took a seat.

59
00:03:16.582 --> 00:03:19.363
"Do you know where this poor boy is now?"

60
00:03:19.763 --> 00:03:20.163
asked Mr.

61
00:03:20.203 --> 00:03:22.304
Brownlow with a look of deep concern on his face.

62
00:03:24.228 --> 00:03:25.068
"No, I don't."

63
00:03:26.229 --> 00:03:27.449
"Then what do you know of him?"

64
00:03:27.789 --> 00:03:29.169
Mr. Brownlow said impatiently.

65
00:03:29.189 --> 00:03:32.991
"Please tell me what you know about Oliver as quickly as possible."

66
00:03:34.051 --> 00:03:39.252
Mr. Bumble put down his hat, unbuttoned his coat, folded his arms, and bowed his head in a

67
00:03:39.292 --> 00:03:39.952
thoughtful manner.

68
00:03:41.013 --> 00:03:43.473
After a few moments of reflection, he began his story.

69
00:03:43.493 --> 00:03:47.415
"I am the parish officer at the workhouse where Oliver was born.

70
00:03:48.475 --> 00:03:52.076
Young Oliver was an orphan, the son of low and vicious parents.

71
00:03:53.184 --> 00:03:56.866
Despite a large reward, we have never been able to determine their names.

72
00:03:58.007 --> 00:04:04.150
From the moment of his birth, Oliver displayed no better qualities than treachery, ingratitude, and malice."

73
00:04:05.291 --> 00:04:05.751
Here Mr.

74
00:04:05.771 --> 00:04:07.712
Bumble paused to let his words sink in.

75
00:04:09.433 --> 00:04:12.335
Mr. Brownlow said nothing, but he looked very serious.

76
00:04:12.355 --> 00:04:15.517
"Go on," he said to the parish officer.

77
00:04:15.537 --> 00:04:21.440
"Oliver was apprenticed to an undertaker, a position that any boy would be happy and grateful for.

78
00:04:22.552 --> 00:04:23.553
But was he grateful?

79
00:04:24.774 --> 00:04:31.119
No. He viciously attacked a defenseless boy who was also employed there, and he terrorized the undertaker's wife

80
00:04:31.219 --> 00:04:32.360
and a female servant.

81
00:04:33.561 --> 00:04:36.404
Young Twist knew that he deserved a most horrible punishment.

82
00:04:37.445 --> 00:04:38.565
So what do you think he did?"

83
00:04:38.586 --> 00:04:41.008
"I don't know," said Mr.

84
00:04:41.048 --> 00:04:44.070
Brownlow, who at this point was feeling that he didn't know Oliver at all.

85
00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.912
"He ran away from his master's house.

86
00:04:48.093 --> 00:04:50.876
So, you see, he has a history of running away."

87
00:04:51.924 --> 00:04:53.424
"I fear that what you say is true."

88
00:04:54.465 --> 00:04:56.085
Mr. Brownlow shook his head sadly.

89
00:04:57.145 --> 00:04:58.826
He handed a five-pound note to Mr.

90
00:04:58.846 --> 00:05:02.367
Bumble. "This is not much for your information.

91
00:05:03.487 --> 00:05:07.548
I would gladly have given you three times as much money if your report had been favorable to

92
00:05:07.568 --> 00:05:07.968
the boy."

93
00:05:09.009 --> 00:05:09.709
If only Mr.

94
00:05:09.729 --> 00:05:10.709
Bumble had known that!

95
00:05:11.889 --> 00:05:15.230
He might have presented his little history with a very different slant.

96
00:05:16.411 --> 00:05:20.612
It was too late to do that now, however, so he shook his head gravely and pocketed the

97
00:05:20.652 --> 00:05:22.588
money. After Mr.

98
00:05:22.628 --> 00:05:23.748
Bumble left, Mr.

99
00:05:23.789 --> 00:05:25.709
Brownlow paced the room for a few minutes.

100
00:05:26.969 --> 00:05:29.530
He was very disturbed by the parish officer's tale.

101
00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:33.011
At last he stopped and rang the bell violently.

102
00:05:33.031 --> 00:05:35.412
"Mrs. Bedwin," said Mr.

103
00:05:35.432 --> 00:05:36.892
Brownlow, when the housekeeper appeared.

104
00:05:36.912 --> 00:05:39.473
"That boy Oliver is an impostor."

105
00:05:40.573 --> 00:05:41.613
"It can't be, sir.

106
00:05:42.734 --> 00:05:45.154
It cannot be," insisted the housekeeper.

107
00:05:45.174 --> 00:05:47.215
"What do you mean by that?"

108
00:05:47.615 --> 00:05:48.275
retorted Mr.

109
00:05:48.295 --> 00:05:53.008
Brownlow. "I tell you he is an impostor.

110
00:05:53.028 --> 00:05:54.949
I have just heard a full account of him from birth.

111
00:05:56.109 --> 00:05:58.090
He has been a thorough villain all his life."

112
00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:01.091
"I never will believe it," Mrs.

113
00:06:01.131 --> 00:06:02.452
Bedwin replied indignantly.

114
00:06:02.472 --> 00:06:06.213
"He was a dear, grateful, gentle child, sir."

115
00:06:06.233 --> 00:06:08.834
"Silence!" ordered Mr.

116
00:06:08.854 --> 00:06:12.136
Brownlow. "Never let me hear the boy's name again.

117
00:06:13.296 --> 00:06:14.257
I rang to tell you that.

118
00:06:15.437 --> 00:06:17.178
Never, never, on any pretense.

119
00:06:18.238 --> 00:06:19.199
You may leave the room, Mrs.

120
00:06:19.219 --> 00:06:22.500
Bedwin. Remember, I am in earnest about this."

121
00:06:23.628 --> 00:06:24.869
There were sad hearts at Mr.

122
00:06:24.889 --> 00:06:26.030
Brownlow's house that night.

123
00:06:27.191 --> 00:06:27.711
Although Mr.

124
00:06:27.751 --> 00:06:31.213
Brownlow sounded angry, he was more disappointed than truly angry.

125
00:06:32.234 --> 00:06:36.637
Back at Fagin's house, Oliver's heart sank whenever he thought of his warm, kind friends.

126
00:06:37.738 --> 00:06:40.420
It was a good thing that he did not know what they had heard that day.

127
00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:42.601
If he had known about Mr.

128
00:06:42.621 --> 00:06:45.703
Bumble's words, his heart might have broken completely.
